@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft JhengHei"
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
left to right direction
title 使用個案圖：錢包、會員成長與客服模組

actor 會員 as Member
actor "AI 服務" as AI
actor 管理員 as Admin

rectangle "SaveMyBook 系統" {
  usecase "查看錢包餘額/\n交易紀錄" as UC1
  usecase "查看待撥款項" as UC2
  usecase "查看常見問題(FAQ)" as UC3
  usecase "建立客服工單" as UC4
  usecase "回覆/結案客服工單" as UC5
  usecase "AI客服對話" as UC6
  usecase "AI客服轉真人\n(升級為工單)" as UC7
  usecase "查看會員等級與\n成就進度" as UC8
  usecase "管理員手動調整\n會員錢包餘額" as UC9
  usecase "管理員處理客服工單" as UC10
}

Member --> UC1
Member --> UC2
Member --> UC3
Member --> UC4
Member --> UC5
Member --> UC6
Member --> UC8
UC6 ..> UC7 : <<extend>>
UC7 ..> UC4 : <<include>>
UC6 --> AI

Admin --> UC9
Admin --> UC10
UC5 <.. UC10 : <<extend>>

note bottom of UC9
  目前系統尚未開放使用者
  自助儲值／提領，
  相關需求須聯絡客服，
  由管理員於後台手動調整。
end note
@enduml
